data: {"type":"toolResult","tool_result":{"call":{"provider":"call_N7XvKY5TH7lAMma9Q8Upn7cD"},"name":"search_world","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nightjar (ship, courier ship) [ID: 36eac936-9ce0-4b27-9bf4-f77ae290dfa1]: A courier ship captained by Asha Pell. It carries blue salt from Orin to Vesper only between April and September.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18769-1953-7785-bf1a-1d436775cbaf\n  - ← CAPTAINS from Asha Pell (person) [ID: 5affd0ca-9c42-4463-bed7-ad12e3c38d62] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Asha Pell was born on Orin and moved to Vesper at age six, where she grew up. She captains the courier ship Nightjar and belongs to the Lantern Guild; her crew usually calls her Captain Ash. She has a small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff; only her navigator, Iven Marr, knows she has it.\n  - ← NAVIGATES from Iven Marr (person) [ID: 1b66c764-9ef7-438c-afa7-22338885a61e]: Asha Pell's navigator and the only person who knows she has a small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff. He lost his right eye in the winter storm of 312. He navigates the Nightjar using tide charts, not magic.\n  - CARRIES → Blue salt (mineral, resource) [ID: a904844d-81e0-40dd-9f91-77fbdc115adb]: Salt used to power the lenses of Vesper's lighthouse; mined on the island of Orin.\n\nBrinewake (island chain) [ID: 382a433a-7cae-4f52-8791-9b8053ab079f]: A stormy island chain.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18769-1953-7785-bf1a-1d436775cbaf\n  - ← LOCATED_IN from Vesper (city, port city) [ID: ccb13663-df18-4e63-b89c-006464a6cfb2]: Brinewake's main port city, built around a tidal lighthouse.\n\nIven Marr (person) [ID: 1b66c764-9ef7-438c-afa7-22338885a61e]: Asha Pell's navigator and the only person who knows she has a small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff. He lost his right eye in the winter storm of 312. He navigates the Nightjar using tide charts, not magic.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18769-1953-7785-bf1a-1d436775cbaf\n  - NAVIGATOR_FOR → Asha Pell (person) [ID: 5affd0ca-9c42-4463-bed7-ad12e3c38d62] [Aliases: Captain Ash]: Asha Pell was born on Orin and moved to Vesper at age six, where she grew up. She captains the courier ship Nightjar and belongs to the Lantern Guild; her crew usually calls her Captain Ash. She has a small brass key sewn inside her left coat cuff; only her navigator, Iven Marr, knows she has it.\n  - KNOWS_ABOUT → Small brass key (key, item) [ID: b21607b8-9ea1-4eb5-bfad-67f4d24554c8]: A small brass key sewn inside Asha Pell's left coat cuff. It opens the old lens room beneath Vesper's lighthouse.\n  - NAVIGATES → Nightjar (ship, courier ship) [ID: 36eac936-9ce0-4b27-9bf4-f77ae290dfa1]: A courier ship captained by Asha Pell. It carries blue salt from Orin to Vesper only between April and September.\n\nButton (animal, cat) [ID: 5a5142e4-31b3-4604-8536-653ad05a027f]: A black cat kept by Nessa aboard the fishing boat Petrel.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18769-1953-7785-bf1a-1d436775cbaf\n  - ← KEEPS from Nessa (person) [ID: d6b40b39-0aa2-4423-997e-0df62bff07c7]: Nessa is Bren Vale's older sister and the cook aboard the fishing boat Petrel. She is not Bren's employee on a formal wage. She keeps a black cat called Button aboard.\n  - ABOARD → Petrel (boat, fishing boat) [ID: 3f555d2a-f6ee-476b-93e5-79e9ae67c110]: A fishing boat captained by Bren Vale, with his older sister Nessa as its cook. Nessa keeps a black cat called Button aboard.\n\nVesper lighthouse (lighthouse, landmark) [ID: 18f09cc9-0d1f-4860-a786-04aae26429af]: The tidal lighthouse around which Vesper is built. Its lenses run on blue salt and it is maintained by the Lantern Guild.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18769-1953-7785-bf1a-1d436775cbaf\n  - ← LOCATED_BENEATH from Old lens room (room, location) [ID: 6f9156cc-d754-4aa5-b17d-828367571776]: A room beneath Vesper's lighthouse, opened by Asha Pell's small brass key. It was permanently sealed by a rockfall in 318; nobody has reopened it, and it has no other entrance.\n  - LOCATED_IN → Vesper (city, port city) [ID: ccb13663-df18-4e63-b89c-006464a6cfb2]: Brinewake's main port city, built around a tidal lighthouse.\n  - MAINTAINED_BY → Lantern Guild (guild) [ID: a4140448-57b9-47e2-9fad-b44a4a957bdd]: Maintains Vesper's tidal lighthouse and buys blue salt from Orin's miners. It does not own the mines. During winter, when the strait freezes, the guild uses stored salt. The guild opposes the toll on blue salt shipments imposed in 319.\n  - USES → Blue salt (mineral, resource) [ID: a904844d-81e0-40dd-9f91-77fbdc115adb]: Salt used to power the lenses of Vesper's lighthouse; mined on the island of Orin."}]}}

