data: {"type":"streamAssistantItem","item":"event","value":{"event":"end","part":1,"content":{"type":"text","text":"Got it: the *Nightjar* now carries letters from Vesper to Kest, a southern island. The April–September blue-salt route is retired, not a second current route."}}}

data: {"type":"streamAssistantItem","item":"event","value":{"event":"end","part":0,"content":{"type":"reasoning","text":"**Acknowledge changes in lore**\n\nI need to acknowledge the retcon explicitly. Earlier lore mentioned the old salt route along with the current routes. I shouldn't worry too much about seasonal storage still being true, but I also need to be careful not to imply that there's alternate cargo. Just keeping things straightforward and succinct should help clarify everything. Let’s make sure the user understands the updates without any confusion!","native":{"item":{"reasoning":"**Acknowledge changes in lore**\n\nI need to acknowledge the retcon explicitly. Earlier lore mentioned the old salt route along with the current routes. I shouldn't worry too much about seasonal storage still being true, but I also need to be careful not to imply that there's alternate cargo. Just keeping things straightforward and succinct should help clarify everything. Let’s make sure the user understands the updates without any confusion!","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.summary","summary":"**Acknowledge changes in lore**\n\nI need to acknowledge the retcon explicitly. Earlier lore mentioned the old salt route along with the current routes. I shouldn't worry too much about seasonal storage still being true, but I also need to be careful not to imply that there's alternate cargo. Just keeping things straightforward and succinct should help clarify everything. Let’s make sure the user understands the updates without any confusion!","format":"openai-responses-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"gAAAAABq4y-YW36_edCzdHkI5m9vKxmtutYu__q3PQuNC7xvSM5o6AVCguL-9ZF25GK0tMgBblE7Egu2ILRQ_xeYc14SyFxYUFdpXnIsRR_rqtsPlUqWiZaPPs50Cgg4cIWeXvPr69uKf-FEZk0yRaqPRgXkEbETo4EjnUKy8zZYVoYhVFdRt8Vxbk0XqzFA1Vhr_-QxynIkJ0IsgCzKUzY4xUpnJog6C4eQty8fExasd8_3oOVmaAun6-xN4PzuZYPp52LvKmxJiHvLKWyAr-9fjZJTi6ATem0HVAgQNeHYLw0ek7b-d6CsFcKsIhSiFUkMiiuKAjplDcAA06Ts-79pzR4SpLhX6hKXvgP8NZpb